OL,3,GNEWSANew Manchester leader makes
OL,4,Ahousing top priority
OL,5,
OL,6,FManchester's new council leader has
OL,7,Fsaid delivering more homes is an
OL,8,F"absolute priority" as he set out his
OL,9,Fambitions for the city.
OL,11,FGarry Bridges told BBC Radio
OL,12,FManchester's Joe McGrath Breakfast Show
OL,13,Fthat high-rise developments had a place
OL,14,Fin Manchester's housing mix, but were
OL,15,Fnot affordable to everyone.
OL,17,FThe council aims to help deliver 36,000
OL,18,Fhomes by 2032, including at least
OL,19,F10,000 social, council or genuinely
OL,20,Faffordable homes. The council said
OL,21,Falmost a quarter of the affordable
OL,22,Fhomes target had already been met.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
